---
---
<section id="contact" class="contact section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <h2>Envie d'échanger ?</h2>
      <p>Je suis à votre écoute. N’hésitez pas à me laisser un message, je vous répondrai rapidement.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-container">
      <form action="https://formspree.io/f/manpdpbz" method="POST" data-reveal>
        <label for="contact-name">Votre nom</label>
        <input id="contact-name" type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
        <label for="contact-email">Votre mail</label>
        <input id="contact-email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required>
        <label for="contact-message">Votre message</label>
        <textarea id="contact-message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
        <button class="submit" type="submit">Envoyer</button>
      </form>
      <span class="line"></span>
      <div class="phone-container" data-reveal style="--i: 2">
        <img src="/phone.webp" alt="" width="100" height="100">
        <p>Ou contactez-moi directement au :</p>
        <a class="phone-number" href="tel:+33686065341">06 86 06 53 41</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--color-dark-blue), var(--color-night));
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .contact h2 {
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .section-head p {
    max-width: 34rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .flex-container {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 30rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  label {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  input,
  textarea {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    background-color: var(--color-white);
    color: var(--color-night);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
  }

  textarea {
    resize: vertical;
  }

  input:focus-visible,
  textarea:focus-visible {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-sand);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(232, 217, 182, 0.35);
  }

  .submit {
    align-self: flex-end;
    padding: 0.8rem 2.25rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-sand);
    color: var(--color-night);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.4s, transform 0.4s var(--ease-calm);
  }

  .submit:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-white);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .submit:focus-visible,
  .phone-number:focus-visible {
    outline-color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .line {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: rgba(255, 250, 239, 0.35);
  }

  .phone-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .phone-container img {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .phone-number {
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-white);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .phone-number:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.3em;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .flex-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1px 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      max-width: 56rem;
    }

    .line {
      width: 1px;
      height: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
